893	     * Assigns the deterministic shared {@code householdId} to a newly created owner. The identifier
894	     * is derived from the owner's household identity — its {@code lastName} and {@code postcode} (see
895	     * {@link #householdIdFor(String, String)}) — so every owner sharing a last name and postcode
896	     * resolves to the same stable value automatically, without any explicit linking. An owner without
897	     * a postcode belongs to no shared household and is left without a household identifier.
898	     *
899	     * @param owner the newly created owner, mutated in place with its household identifier
900	     */
